{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國天后Ariana Grande今年9月初完成巡唱之後開始「放大假」，而早前她為宣傳電影新作《非常外父4：霍家有喜事》（Focker-In-Law）而復出，她昨日就宣布下月推出巡唱《Eternal Sunshine Tour》的電影與紀錄片。</p><p>紀錄片將率先於12月11日於Peacock頻道推出，翌日再推出演唱會電影。粉絲對Ariana推出演唱會電影與紀錄片而大為驚喜。暫時未知Ariana屆時會否再度公開露面宣傳兩部新作。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:43:52.216409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T04:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T17:37:41.899088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:37:14.802852+00:00","content_hash":"6f7286f457523f8ab22529fcc954f17bd06c85781b43c0e50e9eb4880dd12844","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}